  "system": {
    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p>Assassins and petty thugs favor the smallest of the Vibro weapons, the Vibrodagger. A number of civilians carry it for defense. It alone among Vibro weapons is subject to very little regulation, since it is viewed as a common tool for crafters and explorers. </p><p>A Vibrodagger requires an <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Energy_Cell\" title=\"Energy Cell\">Energy Cell</a> to operate. </p><p><b>Special:</b> Vibrodaggers can be <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Thrown\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Thrown\">Thrown</a> </p>",
